Joomla security scanner used in web penetration testing to quickly find known weaknesses in Joomla-based websites.


                                                                                          Why JoomScan is useful 🔍


1. Joomla CMS Detection
Confirms whether a website is running Joomla
Detects Joomla version (sometimes partial)


2. Finds Known Vulnerabilities
Checks for publicly known vulnerabilities (CVEs) related to: Joomla core
                                                            Installed components
                                                            Modules & plugins
                                                            Very useful for quick recon during pentesting

3. Enumerates Components & Paths

Identifies: Installed Joomla components
            Common misconfigurations
            Exposed directories & files
            Helps you decide next attack vectors



4. Detects Security Misconfigurations
Backup files (.bak, .old, .zip)
Exposed admin panels
Weak or missing security headers


                                                                                                Tool Usage


sudo apt install joomscan
joomscan -u https://dishtv.in/
